  know:'You need the card and a couch cushion. The crinkle is the star: paper tablecloth, baking sheet, or actual wrapping paper — make the sound, name the sound, laugh at the sound.',
  why:'The exam bed is usually the first thing the child meets in the real room. A child who has sat on a "crinkle bed" at home climbs straight up at the clinic — position wins half the check-up.',
