  teach:'1) Show the card: "this is where check-ups happen."\n2) Name the furniture: exam bed, sink, poster, stool.\n3) Make the crinkle sound at home and make it funny — "the bed talks!"\n4) Build an exam room: cushion bed, teddy patient, paper "poster."\n5) At the real room: "the crinkle bed! Just like the card. Climb up."',
  say:'"Exam room! This is where check-ups happen. Sit on the big bed — CRINKLE! It talks! Teddy sits next to you, and the doctor will be right in."',
